Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nice to move about a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've put up a punchbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to burn off energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Jakob was on at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows where to dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Never marry a psychologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows I fucked someone, not that it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,One of his patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never find out either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He was so nasty to me when we talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Help yourself to tea.
